    "notes": {
        "e000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011": {
            "x": 144,
            "y": -224,
            "width": 640,
            "height": 288,
            "content": "## @apx-vero mention -> Claude mention responder\n\nStarts `.github/workflows/claude-mention-responder.yml` in `Appmixer-ai/appmixer-connectors` when a person mentions `@apx-vero` on a PR — in the conversation, inline on a diff line, or in a review body. One chain per kind: trigger -> Condition -> Repository Dispatch.\n\n**Why dispatch:** inline comments and reviews on fork PRs run without secrets in Actions; `repository_dispatch` always has them and is never gated.\n\n**Source of truth:** `.github/appmixer-flows/apx-vero-mention-dispatch.json` in the connectors repo."
        },
        "e000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012": {
            "x": 784,
            "y": 128,
            "width": 320,
            "height": 320,
            "content": "### Payload: ids only\n\n`{kind, id, pr_number}` — the workflow fetches the mention text itself, so nothing in the dispatch can smuggle content in.\n\n**Conditions** read `input`/`operator`/`value`; `field`/`expected` would let everything through.\n\n**Loops:** apx-vero's own replies are excluded here and again in the workflow; each reply carries a marker, so a duplicate dispatch is a no-op.\n\n**Account:** vtalas (dispatch needs push)."
        }
    }
